      "content": "That's a helpful overview. Given the data on rising social isolation and the breakdown of traditional community structures, it seems like many sociologists are finding that the decline of religious involvement is a primary driver of this instability. Can you go deeper into the specific mechanisms by which the loss of these religious frameworks causes the erosion of the social fabric?",
